  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "packet_list: Promptly reflect changes to Marked state",
  "description": "If frame.marked is added as a custom column, updates to the\nframe.marked state of packets will not be immediately reflected\nin the packet list until some other event such as adding a\npacket comment or ignoring a frame ultimately triggers\nredrawVisiblePackets().\n\nAdd redrawVisiblePackets() in a few places to promptly trigger\nupdates to the frame.marked state when displayed in packet list.",
